.SS Prefix mode
.P
Use \fB\-\-prefix\fP (\fB\-p\fP) for CI or headless environments\. Output is printed with colored \fB[name]\fP prefixes instead of the TUI:
.RS 2
.nf
numux \-\-prefix
.fi
.RE
.P
Auto\-exits when all processes finish\. Exit code 1 if any process failed\.
